TASK-220 runtime harness: an action popup's popover size from the main
window's pinned button (faux address bar) and from the Quick Detour bar's
pinned button, at open, after the page grows and after it shrinks.
Temporary code, never committed to Detour/. Gated on DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR;
DETOUR_VERIFY_APPEARANCE light or dark (also launch with
-AppleInterfaceStyle Dark); DETOUR_VERIFY_FIXTURE a loopback server
(python3 -I -m http.server 8937 over a dir with index.html, title
"Lookup Page"); DETOUR_VERIFY_EXT an unpacked MV3 extension "Verify Popup
Size" whose popup.html is a 220x300 box (no body margin, a red corner
square, color-scheme light dark) with a Grow/Shrink button (popup.js)
toggling it to 340x420. Installed with ExtensionManager.install(from:) and
pinned in Default. Data dirs DetourVerify2200 (old code), 2201, 2202.

Measured in-process: the popover window's frame, the popup web view's frame
and intrinsicContentSize, and in the page innerWidth/innerHeight, the corner
square's bottom-right and prefers-color-scheme. The Grow button is pressed
with a posted click and, when that does not reach the page, from script
(the page's own handler either way). run.sh logs SHOOTRECT lines for
screencapture -R and kills only the PID it launched after "done".

    git apply docs/harness/task220-harness.patch && xcodegen generate
    xcodebuild -scheme Detour -configuration Debug build -derivedDataPath .derived
    run.sh light; run.sh dark
    git apply -R docs/harness/task220-harness.patch && xcodegen generate

